A monoubiquitination, POLH recruitment to replication factories and efficient translesion DNA synthesis (PubMed:24657165). Plays a key role in the transcriptional regulation of T lymphocyte development (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}